%U A398488 1,0,3,1,0,1,1,1,2,0,0,2
%N A398488 Number of primes between the n-th odd semiprime and the following odd semiprime.
%F A398488 a(n) = A000720(A046315(n+1)) - A000720(A046315(n)).
%e A398488 a(1) = 2 because the 1st and 2nd odd semiprimes are 9 and 15, and there are exactly 2 primes strictly between them (11 and 13).
%e A398488 a(5) = 0 because the 5th and 6th odd semiprimes are 33 and 35, and there are no primes between them.
